            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1866-630 Combo Push/Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of heavy 11 gauge (1/8\") thick stainless steel, this combination door pull and push plate is primarily used on double acting (door swings both directions) stores, warehouses, factories and  restaurant doors.  Packaged with #8 x 3/4\" sheet metal screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1866-630_size.gif?v=1704354546\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1866-630 Combo Push Pull Plate dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Don-Jo 1866-630 Combo Push/Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Plate Height: 16-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Flat Plate Height: 15-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .125\" </li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Stainless</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1866-630.pdf?v=1704262301\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1866-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> \r\n</p>",
